<title>AUSTRIA: Austria cen bank allots 1.83 bln ats in 2-wk repos.</title>
<headline>Austria cen bank allots 1.83 bln ats in 2-wk repos.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1997-01-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Austrian National Bank said on Friday it had allotted 1.83 billion schillings ($159.1 million) in two-week repos at a fixed rate of 3.0 percent, unchanged from last week.</p>
<p>The bank said it had filled two percent of bids.</p>
<p>Last week, the central bank allotted 4.99 billion schillings in two-week repos, filling five percent of bids.</p>
<p>-- Vienna Newsroom, 43-1-53112-254 ($ = 11.50 Austrian Schillings)</p>
